{"created": "2026-08-24T23:18:50.477888+00:00", "modified": "2026-08-24T23:18:50.661314+00:00", "id": 22087934, "conceptrecid": "21977665", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22087934", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21977665", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22087934", "metadata": {"title": "Evidence archive for Adaptive Wavelet-Band Self-Blending and Multi-Prototype Contrastive Regularization", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22087934", "publication_date": "2026-08-25", "description": "<p>Versioned evidence archive supporting the article &ldquo;Adaptive Wavelet-Band Self-Blending and Multi-Prototype Contrastive Regularization for Cross-Dataset Generalization of Deepfake Detection&rdquo;.</p>\n<p>The archive provides configurations, source-code snapshots, prediction artifacts, evaluation scripts, calibration analyses, experiment passports, integrity manifests, and reproducibility documentation for the second WISER article.</p>\n<p>Version 1.0.5 excludes experiment E07 from the evidence scheme of the second article. E07 concerns disabling the CND architectural component of WISER and requires a separate model retraining; therefore, it is retained only as a protocol for a future architectural study and is not used to support claims about AWB-SBI or RP-MPHC.</p>\n<p>The executable spectral-analysis pipeline for comparing Real, Fake-FF++, Fake-Celeb-DF++, SBI, and AWB-SBI groups was verified end-to-end using a synthetic self-test. The synthetic values are not published or used as scientific evidence. The scientific spectral comparison has not been completed because licensed FaceForensics++ and Celeb-DF++ frames are not distributed with the archive.</p>\n<p>The archive includes the completed E08r post-training comparison, in which calibrated and uncalibrated predictions are evaluated using the same raw E04 logits and the same frame-to-video aggregation rule.</p>\n<p>FaceForensics++ and Celeb-DF++ datasets are not redistributed because they are governed by their respective access conditions. See README.md, CLAIM_LEDGER.md, REPRODUCIBILITY.md, LICENSE.md, and LICENSES/README.md for evidence boundaries, reproducibility instructions, and file-level licensing.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Mozgovoy, Nikolai V.", "affiliation": "Don State Technical University", "orcid": "0009-0000-4104-0074"}, {"name": "Cherckesova, Larisa V.", "affiliation": "Don State Technical University", "orcid": "0000-0002-9392-3140"}, {"name": "Trubchik, Irina S.", "affiliation": "Don State Technical University", "orcid": "0000-0003-2433-3435"}, {"name": "Revyakina, Elena A.", "affiliation": "Don State Technical University", "orcid": "0000-0003-1577-2671"}], "keywords": ["deepfake detection", "cross-dataset generalization", "AWB-SBI", "self-blended images", "RP-MPHC", "contrastive learning", "WISER", "wavelet augmentation", "FaceForensics++", "Celeb-DF++", "model calibration", "reproducible research", "evidence archive"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/vonexel/WISER", "relation": "isDerivedFrom", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.21977665", "relation": "isDerivedFrom", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "doi"}], "version": "1.0.5", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/vonexel/WISER", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 3, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21977665"}}]}}, "title": "Evidence archive for Adaptive Wavelet-Band Self-Blending and Multi-Prototype Contrastive Regularization", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22087934", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22087934", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22087934?preview=1", "doi": "https://do